# Semgrep scope for the CI `semgrep` job (specs/security/ci-semgrep-scan.md REQ-4).
# Without this file Semgrep applies its built-in default list, which also skips
# every test/ and tests/ directory. This file keeps the rest of that default list
# and scans test code too.

# Semgrep's default: common large and generated paths
node_modules/
build/
dist/
vendor/
.env/
.venv/
.tox/
*.min.js
.npm/
.yarn/
*_test.go
.semgrep
.semgrep_logs/

